Database migrations are applied with `flask db upgrade` before production traffic.
The first revision adopts the current schema safely for databases created by the
prototype app and creates missing tables for new databases.

Revision 20261009_33 adds opt-in Admin Builder projects, patch candidates,
Guardian scans/findings, and reviewed lessons. Its upgrade checks for tables
and indexes that the baseline adoption migration may already have created from
the current SQLAlchemy metadata. Always back up a deployment database before
applying migrations.
